{"ok": true, "summary": "The drawing shows front and top views of an electronic expansion valve body assembly, not a sectional view. Read dimensions are body Ø32 × 60 mm, upper step Ø28 × 35 mm, two Ø9.52 mm connections, lateral projection 40 mm, lower projection 35 mm, and lateral centerline 22 mm above the body base. Notes specify an internal Ø14 bore, Ø1.6 restriction, H62 brass body, TP2 copper pipes, and PA66 coil seat. The rotatable reconstruction includes a cutaway and exploded view. Assumptions are 0.8 mm pipe walls, a 52 mm blind bore starting 4 mm above the base, a 4 mm restriction length, and an undimensioned Ø20 × 6 mm top cap. Upper-step material assignment and internal connectivity require confirmation.", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>EXV Drawing Reconstruction</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#28313b}\n#panel h3{margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px}\n.row{margin:5px 0;line-height:1.35}\n.legend{font-size:11px}\nbutton{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:11px}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\n#buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:15%;right:15%;padding:16px;background:white;color:#bd182c;text-align:center}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>EXV · drawing reconstruction</h3>\n<div class=\"row\">Views: front + top; dimensions in mm.</div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"dims\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"pipes\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"internal\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"assume\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"result\"></div>\n<div class=\"legend\">● <span style=\"color:#c9a227\">H62 brass</span> · <span style=\"color:#b87333\">TP2 copper</span></div>\n<div class=\"legend\">● PA66 seat (assumed location) · <span style=\"color:#3b82f6\">Blue: inferred fluid</span></div>\n<div class=\"legend\">No threads, seals or actuator internals specified.</div>\n<div id=\"buttons\"><button id=\"section\">Section view</button><button id=\"explode\">Exploded view</button><button id=\"rotate\">Auto-rotate: on</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\n// All lengths are mm; densities are g/cm³. Unspecified internals are assumptions.\nconst P = {\n bodyD:32, bodyH:60, upperD:28, upperH:35,\n pipeOD:9.52, pipeWall:0.8, sideLength:40, lowerLength:35, sideY:22,\n boreD:14, boreBottom:4, boreLength:52, restrictionD:1.6,\n capD:20, capH:6, brassDensity:8.5, copperDensity:8.96,\n plasticDensity:1.4, brassColor:'#c9a227', copperColor:'#b87333',\n plasticColor:'#2b2b2b', fluidColor:'#3b82f6',\n metalness:0.85, roughness:0.35, plasticRoughness:0.6,\n segments:64, explodeSide:24, explodeBottom:20, explodeUpper:22\n};\nfunction showError(message){\n const el=document.getElementById('error');\n el.style.display='block';el.textContent='Model error: '+message;\n}\nwindow.addEventListener('error',e=>showError(e.message));\ntry {\n const scene=new THREE.Scene();\n scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\n const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\n renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));\n renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n renderer.localClippingEnabled=true;\n document.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n scene.environment=new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer).fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(),0.04).texture;\n scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,0.6));\n const light=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);\n light.position.set(100,180,160);scene.add(light);\n const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\n const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);\n controls.enableDamping=true;controls.autoRotate=true;controls.autoRotateSpeed=1.0;\n controls.addEventListener('start',()=>{controls.autoRotate=false;updateRotate();});\n const modelGroup=new THREE.Group();scene.add(modelGroup);\n const cutPlane=new THREE.Plane(new THREE.Vector3(0,0,-1),0);\n const solidMaterials=[];\n function metal(color,plastic=false){\n  const material=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\n   color,metalness:plastic?0:P.metalness,roughness:plastic?P.plasticRoughness:P.roughness,\n   side:THREE.DoubleSide\n  });\n  solidMaterials.push(material);return material;\n }\n const brass=metal(P.brassColor),copper=metal(P.copperColor),plastic=metal(P.plasticColor,true);\n const fluid=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\n  color:P.fluidColor,transparent:true,opacity:0.55,depthWrite:false,roughness:0.3\n });\n const body=new THREE.Group(),upper=new THREE.Group(),side=new THREE.Group(),bottom=new THREE.Group();\n modelGroup.add(body,upper,side,bottom);\n function cylinder(radius,length,material,parent,x,y,horizontal=false){\n  const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(radius,radius,length,P.segments),material);\n  if(horizontal)mesh.rotation.z=-Math.PI/2;\n  mesh.position.set(x,y,0);parent.add(mesh);return mesh;\n }\n function tube(outer,inner,length,material,parent,x,y,horizontal=false){\n  const points=[\n   new THREE.Vector2(inner,-length/2),new THREE.Vector2(outer,-length/2),\n   new THREE.Vector2(outer,length/2),new THREE.Vector2(inner,length/2),\n   new THREE.Vector2(inner,-length/2)\n  ];\n  const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.LatheGeometry(points,P.segments),material);\n  if(horizontal)mesh.rotation.z=-Math.PI/2;\n  mesh.position.set(x,y,0);parent.add(mesh);return mesh;\n }\n const r=P.bodyD/2,b=P.boreD/2,ri=P.pipeOD/2-P.pipeWall;\n // Lathed body has a blind chamber and a true bottom restriction.\n const profile=[\n  [P.restrictionD/2,0],[r,0],[r,P.bodyH],[0,P.bodyH],\n  [0,P.boreBottom+P.boreLength],[b,P.boreBottom+P.boreLength],\n  [b,P.boreBottom],[P.restrictionD/2,P.boreBottom],[P.restrictionD/2,0]\n ].map(v=>new THREE.Vector2(v[0],v[1]));\n const bodyMesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.LatheGeometry(profile,P.segments),brass);\n body.add(bodyMesh);\n // Remove the transverse drilling from the body shell using an analytic shader cut.\n brass.onBeforeCompile=shader=>{\n  shader.uniforms.portRadius={value:ri};shader.uniforms.portY={value:P.sideY};\n  shader.vertexShader=shader.vertexShader.replace('#include <common>','#include <common>\\nvarying vec3 localPoint;');\n  shader.vertexShader=shader.vertexShader.replace('#include <begin_vertex>','#include <begin_vertex>\\nlocalPoint=position;');\n  shader.fragmentShader=shader.fragmentShader.replace('#include <common>',\n   '#include <common>\\nvarying vec3 localPoint;\\nuniform float portRadius;\\nuniform float portY;');\n  shader.fragmentShader=shader.fragmentShader.replace('#include <clipping_planes_fragment>',\n   '#include <clipping_planes_fragment>\\nif(localPoint.x>0.0 && length(vec2(localPoint.y-portY,localPoint.z))<portRadius) discard;');\n };\n // A matching cylindrical wall represents the drilled port surface.\n const portGeo=new THREE.CylinderGeometry(ri,ri,r-b,P.segments,1,true);\n const portMat=metal(P.brassColor);\n const portWall=new THREE.Mesh(portGeo,portMat);\n portWall.rotation.z=-Math.PI/2;portWall.position.set((r+b)/2,P.sideY,0);body.add(portWall);\n cylinder(P.upperD/2,P.upperH,plastic,upper,0,P.bodyH+P.upperH/2);\n cylinder(P.capD/2,P.capH,plastic,upper,0,P.bodyH+P.upperH+P.capH/2);\n tube(P.pipeOD/2,ri,P.sideLength,copper,side,r+P.sideLength/2,P.sideY,true);\n tube(P.pipeOD/2,ri,P.lowerLength,copper,bottom,0,-P.lowerLength/2);\n const fluidGroup=new THREE.Group();modelGroup.add(fluidGroup);\n cylinder(b,P.boreLength,fluid,fluidGroup,0,P.boreBottom+P.boreLength/2);\n cylinder(P.restrictionD/2,P.boreBottom,fluid,fluidGroup,0,P.boreBottom/2);\n cylinder(ri,P.lowerLength,fluid,fluidGroup,0,-P.lowerLength/2);\n cylinder(ri,r+P.sideLength,fluid,fluidGroup,(r+P.sideLength)/2,P.sideY,true);\n fluidGroup.visible=false;\n // Numerical integration of the port's intersection with the annular body.\n let portVolume=0;\n const n=4000,dz=2*ri/n;\n for(let i=0;i<n;i++){\n  const z=-ri+(i+0.5)*dz;\n  portVolume+=2*Math.sqrt(ri*ri-z*z)*(Math.sqrt(r*r-z*z)-Math.sqrt(b*b-z*z))*dz;\n }\n const brassVolume=Math.PI*r*r*P.bodyH-Math.PI*b*b*P.boreLength\n  -Math.PI*(P.restrictionD/2)**2*P.boreBottom-portVolume;\n const copperVolume=Math.PI*((P.pipeOD/2)**2-ri*ri)*(P.sideLength+P.lowerLength);\n const plasticVolume=Math.PI/4*(P.upperD**2*P.upperH+P.capD**2*P.capH);\n const brassMass=brassVolume*P.brassDensity/1e6;\n const copperMass=copperVolume*P.copperDensity/1e6;\n const plasticMass=plasticVolume*P.plasticDensity/1e6;\n const metrics=[\n  {label:'Main body diameter',value:P.bodyD.toFixed(2),unit:'mm',note:'Read from front and top views'},\n  {label:'Main body height',value:P.bodyH.toFixed(2),unit:'mm',note:'Read from front view'},\n  {label:'Overall height',value:(P.lowerLength+P.bodyH+P.upperH+P.capH).toFixed(2),unit:'mm',note:'Includes assumed 6 mm top cap'},\n  {label:'Brass body mass',value:brassMass.toFixed(3),unit:'kg',note:'Assumed bore; drilled port deducted'},\n  {label:'Copper pipe mass',value:copperMass.toFixed(3),unit:'kg',note:'Assumed 0.8 mm walls; no insertion'},\n  {label:'Estimated assembly mass',value:(brassMass+copperMass+plasticMass).toFixed(3),unit:'kg',note:'Includes solid PA66 seat; no actuator'}\n ];\n window.__metrics=metrics;\n document.getElementById('dims').textContent=`Body Ø${P.bodyD} × ${P.bodyH}; upper Ø${P.upperD} × ${P.upperH}.`;\n document.getElementById('pipes').textContent=`Pipes Ø${P.pipeOD}: side ${P.sideLength}, lower ${P.lowerLength}; side axis +${P.sideY}.`;\n document.getElementById('internal').textContent=`Read: bore Ø${P.boreD}; restriction Ø${P.restrictionD}.`;\n document.getElementById('assume').textContent=`Assumed: wall ${P.pipeWall}; bore length ${P.boreLength}, base ${P.boreBottom}; cap Ø${P.capD} × ${P.capH}.`;\n document.getElementById('result').textContent=`Envelope ${P.bodyD+P.sideLength} × ${P.bodyD} × ${P.lowerLength+P.bodyH+P.upperH+P.capH}; estimated ${metrics[5].value} kg.`;\n const box=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(modelGroup,true);\n const center=box.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()),size=box.getSize(new THREE.Vector3());\n const grid=new THREE.GridHelper(240,12,0xd9d5ce,0xe7e2da);\n grid.position.y=box.min.y-1;scene.add(grid);\n function fit(){\n  const angle=Math.min(camera.fov*Math.PI/360,Math.atan(Math.tan(camera.fov*Math.PI/360)*camera.aspect));\n  const distance=size.length()/2/Math.sin(angle)/0.70;\n  camera.position.copy(center).add(new THREE.Vector3(1,0.7,1.2).normalize().multiplyScalar(distance));\n  controls.target.copy(center);controls.update();\n }\n fit();\n let section=false,exploded=false;\n document.getElementById('section').onclick=()=>{\n  section=!section;\n  solidMaterials.forEach(m=>{m.clippingPlanes=section?[cutPlane]:[];m.needsUpdate=true;});\n  fluidGroup.visible=section&&!exploded;\n  document.getElementById('section').textContent=section?'Full view':'Section view';\n };\n document.getElementById('explode').onclick=()=>{\n  exploded=!exploded;\n  side.position.x=exploded?P.explodeSide:0;\n  bottom.position.y=exploded?-P.explodeBottom:0;\n  upper.position.y=exploded?P.explodeUpper:0;\n  fluidGroup.visible=section&&!exploded;\n  document.getElementById('explode').textContent=exploded?'Assembled view':'Exploded view';\n };\n function updateRotate(){document.getElementById('rotate').textContent='Auto-rotate: '+(controls.autoRotate?'on':'off');}\n document.getElementById('rotate').onclick=()=>{controls.autoRotate=!controls.autoRotate;updateRotate();};\n window.__scene=scene;window.__camera=camera;window.__renderer=renderer;\n window.__controls=controls;window.__model=modelGroup;\n window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{\n  camera.aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n  renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n });\n renderer.setAnimationLoop(()=>{controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera);});\n} catch(error){showError(error.message);}\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "metrics": [{"label": "Main body diameter", "value": "32.00", "unit": "mm", "note": "Read from front and top views"}, {"label": "Main body height", "value": "60.00", "unit": "mm", "note": "Read from front view"}, {"label": "Overall height", "value": "136.00", "unit": "mm", "note": "Includes assumed 6 mm top cap"}, {"label": "Brass body mass", "value": "0.339", "unit": "kg", "note": "Assumed bore; drilled port deducted"}, {"label": "Copper pipe mass", "value": "0.015", "unit": "kg", "note": "Assumed 0.8 mm walls; no insertion"}, {"label": "Estimated assembly mass", "value": "0.387", "unit": "kg", "note": "Includes solid PA66 seat; no actuator"}], "suggestions": ["Show dimension labels on the 3D model.", "Compare 0.8 mm and 1.0 mm pipe walls.", "Highlight all inferred features for drawing verification."], "raw": "<<<SUMMARY>>>\nThe drawing shows front and top views of an electronic expansion valve body assembly, not a sectional view. Read dimensions are body Ø32 × 60 mm, upper step Ø28 × 35 mm, two Ø9.52 mm connections, lateral projection 40 mm, lower projection 35 mm, and lateral centerline 22 mm above the body base. Notes specify an internal Ø14 bore, Ø1.6 restriction, H62 brass body, TP2 copper pipes, and PA66 coil seat. The rotatable reconstruction includes a cutaway and exploded view. Assumptions are 0.8 mm pipe walls, a 52 mm blind bore starting 4 mm above the base, a 4 mm restriction length, and an undimensioned Ø20 × 6 mm top cap. Upper-step material assignment and internal connectivity require confirmation.\n<<<HTML>>>\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>EXV Drawing Reconstruction</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#28313b}\n#panel h3{margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px}\n.row{margin:5px 0;line-height:1.35}\n.legend{font-size:11px}\nbutton{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:11px}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\n#buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:15%;right:15%;padding:16px;background:white;color:#bd182c;text-align:center}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>EXV · drawing reconstruction</h3>\n<div class=\"row\">Views: front + top; dimensions in mm.</div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"dims\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"pipes\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"internal\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"assume\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"result\"></div>\n<div class=\"legend\">● <span style=\"color:#c9a227\">H62 brass</span> · <span style=\"color:#b87333\">TP2 copper</span></div>\n<div class=\"legend\">● PA66 seat (assumed location) · <span style=\"color:#3b82f6\">Blue: inferred fluid</span></div>\n<div class=\"legend\">No threads, seals or actuator internals specified.</div>\n<div id=\"buttons\"><bu